This site exists once per blog theme baudelaire ships, with the same content in
each. Only the theme changes: the type, the colours, what surrounds the words.

Every page here is a `.typ` file. The posts have dates, tags and summaries, so
the listing, the term pages and the feeds have something to show, and this page
is #link("https://baudelaire.cstef.dev/features/build/typst-modules/")[the site's own catalogue]
rendered by the theme.

Read #link("/posts/")[the posts], open a
#link("/tags/typst/")[tag page], or see
#link("https://baudelaire.cstef.dev/features/build/themes/")[how themes work].
